= Franz Pfeffer von Salomon

Pfeffer von Salomon is a former Prussian army officer and Supreme Commander of the SA. He bridges the gap between formal military discipline and mass mobilization, advocating for a legalist approach to national power.

- @paramilitary_discipline
- @reichswehr_affairs
- @support_peoples_movement
- @build_peoples_movement
- @campaigning_peoples_movement
- @root: Return to main

@paramilitary_discipline
title: Rally for National Discipline
subtitle: Restrain the SA's worst excesses to present a respectable face to the German public.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nationalism_sentiment += 5; legalist_strategy += 1; hitler_loyalist_strength += 5; orthodox_strength += 3; working_class_nsdap += 4*(1-internal_party_dissent) if legalist_strategy >= 4; old_middle_nsdap += 3*(1-internal_party_dissent) if legalist_strategy >= 4

Pfeffer helps enforce strict operational order, pivoting the SA from chaotic brawlers into a disciplined national vanguard.

@reichswehr_affairs
title: Reichswehr Affairs
subtitle: If we hold the Defense Ministry, we can set our formal military policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and nsdap_in_government and reichswehr_minister_party == "NSDAP"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not nsdap_in_government : The NSDAP is not in government. ?][? if reichswehr_minister_party != "NSDAP": The NSDAP does not hold the Reichswehr ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1;
go-to: nsdap_military_policy

@support_peoples_movement
title: Foster a Catch-All People's Movement
subtitle: Can we expand our party footprint far beyond our early radical base?
view-if: catch_all_movement == 0
choose-if: catch_all_support <= 4 and advisor_action_timer = 0 and catch_all_movement == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if catch_all_support > 4: There is already substantial support for a broad electoral strategy. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; catch_all_support += 1

We are building up internal support for evolving into a mass, cross-class movement.

@build_peoples_movement
title: Implementing the Catch-All Strategy
subtitle: Commit the party to expanding beyond industrial or purely rural niches.
view-if: catch_all_movement == 0
choose-if: catch_all_support >= 3 and advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if catch_all_support < 3: There is not enough support for this organizational shift yet. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1;
go-to: catch_all_movement_adoption

@campaigning_peoples_movement
title: Campaigning as a Catch-All Party
subtitle: Exploit our mass structures to aggressively target non-traditional demographics.
view-if: catch_all_movement = 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: catch_all_party_campaigning
